From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AxelGalvez11 <axelgalvez1121@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 21:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 75/75] feat(nemesis): make account flow desktop-first
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Keep credential entry and post-login behavior inside the native desktop app.
Move only account creation and subscription management to the Nemesis browser
portal, and remove the remaining PharmaOrb account language from the desktop.
